@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFF0A8
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor #FFF6D2
skinparam ArrowColor #484334
autonumber
participant "Browser" as P0
participant "BFF replica 1" as P1
participant "BFF replica 2" as P2
participant "Redis" as P3
P0 -> P1: Start login through public edge
P1 -> P3: Shared pending OIDC state
P0 -> P2: Callback reaches replica 2
P2 -> P3: Read shared state
P2 -> P3: Store rotated session and tokens
P2 --> P0: Cookie and UI redirect
P0 -> P1: API request reaches replica 1
P1 -> P3: Read same committed session
P1 --> P0: Authorized API response
@enduml
